WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.870
Episode 20: The Wave That Swallowed the Flower Ship

2
00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:08.874
Entering the sanctum of the Jade Barrier Spire,
the companions discovered that High Elder Zephyr

3
00:00:08.974 --> 00:00:11.840
had already integrated the core mana matrix into
the obsidian apparatus of the Nine Shadows Codex.

4
00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:14.800
Forbidden abyssal mana tainted the jade conduits of the
spire, shaking the foundations of the island. Black lightning

5
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.810
erupted from the apex, cleaving through the ocean horizon and
awakening a catastrophic tidal wave from the sleeping depths.

6
00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:20.767
Ancient mana circulation systems that had maintained the
island's gentle climate for thousands of years inverted

7
00:00:20.867 --> 00:00:23.780
with cataclysmic violence. Staining the heavens crimson as
colossal marble walls fractured and tumbled into the abyss.

8
00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:29.750
Zephyr shrieked in maniacal
ecstasy as he primed the conduits.

9
00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:32.826
[Zephyr] "Foolish Aeolus and witless princess! Whispering
Wind Island shall serve as the grand sacrificial altar

10
00:00:32.926 --> 00:00:35.720
for the new era! Once the ocean swallows everything,
the empire and I shall rule supreme over the continent!"

11
00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:38.625
Kadan and Ignis surged forward,
but a violent concussive shockwave

12
00:00:38.725 --> 00:00:41.690
from the collapsing core swept Zephyr
into a spatial teleportation rift.

13
00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:47.660
Laughing in vile triumph, the traitor
fled toward the imperial capital.

14
00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:50.600
At that moment, the frantic clangor of
the island's temple bells echoed from

15
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:53.630
the harbors below, accompanied by the
terrified screams of thousands of citizens.

16
00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:59.600
Rushing to the terrace, Cilia
looked down and turned pale as ash.

17
00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:02.876
[Celia] "No! Zephyr has dismantled the
elemental barriers, unsealing the oceanic abyss!

18
00:01:02.976 --> 00:01:05.570
A black tsunami hundreds of fathoms
high is bearing down upon the harbor!"

19
00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:08.556
Whispering Wind Island possessed not a single war galley.
Only hundreds of traditional ceremonial 'Flower Boats'—timber

20
00:01:08.656 --> 00:01:11.540
barges festooned with water lilies, lotus blooms, and spring
irises for the equinox festival—were moored along the wharves.

21
00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:14.647
The festive vessels that had once
wafted sweet floral fragrances

22
00:01:14.747 --> 00:01:17.510
were now fragile leaves tossed
before a wall of liquid death.

23
00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:20.981
As the mountain of black
water crested the horizon,

24
00:01:21.081 --> 00:01:23.480
panic consumed the gathering refugees.

25
00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:26.604
Mooring pylons groaned and
snapped under the violent

26
00:01:26.704 --> 00:01:29.450
receding undertow, flooding
the wharves in chaos.

27
00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:35.420
Raising her Jade Staff, Cilia projected her
voice across the harbor with wind magic.

28
00:01:35.620 --> 00:01:38.663
[Celia] "People of Whispering Wind
Island, hear my voice! I am Cilia,

29
00:01:38.763 --> 00:01:41.390
daughter of Queen Sylphid! There
is nowhere on land to flee!

30
00:01:41.590 --> 00:01:43.858
[Celia] Board every flower
barge along the piers!

31
00:01:43.958 --> 00:01:47.360
The festive craft of our ancestors
shall serve as our ark of salvation!"

32
00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:50.857
Inspired by Cilia's clarion
call, the islanders rallied,

33
00:01:50.957 --> 00:01:53.330
boarding the barges in disciplined haste.

34
00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:56.130
Stamping his iron pegleg upon the planks,

35
00:01:56.230 --> 00:01:59.300
Rondol took command of
the dockside evacuations.

36
00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:02.319
[Rondol] "Board the children and elders first!
Thirty souls per barge, sturdy hands to the

37
00:02:02.419 --> 00:02:05.270
oars on port and starboard! By Rondol's name,
the sea shall not claim a single life today!"

38
00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:08.268
Ignis bounded onto the piers, wielding
his pure white flame to incinerate fallen

39
00:02:08.368 --> 00:02:11.240
timber and shattered rocks, carving open
departure channels for the flower barges.

40
00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:14.245
The hands of the former imperial commander now
reached out to lift weeping children and frail elders

41
00:02:14.345 --> 00:02:17.210
safely onto the decks. Bracing fallen beams with his
iron shield, Kadan cleared paths for the elderly.

42
00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:19.897
[Kadan] Kadan called out to
the boatmen. "Make haste!

43
00:02:19.997 --> 00:02:23.180
Cast off the mooring lines before
the deluge swallows the wharves!"

44
00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:25.845
Yet from beyond the boiling
swell rose the Leviathan,

45
00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:29.150
a colossal sea behemoth corrupted
by Medusa Gorgo's necrotic blight.

46
00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:32.072
Riding the crest of the black deluge,
the abomination opened its gaping maw,

47
00:02:32.172 --> 00:02:35.120
charging a cataclysmic beam of shadow mana
aimed squarely at the refugee flotilla.

48
00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:41.090
If the tsunami struck, the wooden flower
boats would be obliterated into splinters.

49
00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:44.125
In that fatal instant, Kadan
bounded onto the timber prow

50
00:02:44.225 --> 00:02:47.060
of the flagship 'Breeze Wing'
at the van of the flotilla.

51
00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:49.696
Grasping his unadorned iron shield with both hands, Kadan drew
the foundational power of the earth deep into his spirit.

52
00:02:49.796 --> 00:02:53.030
The ultimate defensive mystery passed down by Master Aleksandar—the 'Star-Steadfast
Bulwark'—ignited within Kadan's breast in an aura of brilliant starlight.

53
00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:56.349
[Kadan] Planting his boots into the timbers, Kadan unleashed
a lion-hearted roar. "To protect the warmth behind me,

54
00:02:56.449 --> 00:02:59.000
this shield shall never break! Guardians of the
earth, awaken through the breath of the stars!"

55
00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:02.072
A monumental wall of celestial blue starlight erupted from
Kadan's shield. Cilia channeled the tempestuous winds of the Jade

56
00:03:02.172 --> 00:03:04.970
Staff into the barrier, while King Aeolus directed the full
fury of his storm mana from the Sky Altar into Kadan's guard.

57
00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:07.863
Starlight and jade wind
fused into an impenetrable

58
00:03:07.963 --> 00:03:10.940
mountain of protective light
rising from the sea. Boom!

59
00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:13.874
The black tsunami and the Leviathan's necrotic beam
crashed headlong into Kadan's starlight barrier.

60
00:03:13.974 --> 00:03:16.910
A cataclysmic shockwave rent the heavens and the sea,
vaporizing waves into billowing walls of white steam.

61
00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:19.867
The deck beneath Kadan's boots groaned and splintered.
Blood welled through the young warrior's sleeves as veins

62
00:03:19.967 --> 00:03:22.880
strained under the titanic impact, yet his boots remained
wedged into the prow like iron spikes, yielding not an inch.

63
00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:26.165
The apocalyptic tsunami broke against Kadan's shield,
cleaving in two and cascading harmlessly to either side.

64
00:03:26.265 --> 00:03:28.850
Riding through the towering spray, the frail
flower boats crest the swells without capsizing.

65
00:03:29.050 --> 00:03:31.808
Seizing the opening, Ignis vaulted high into the
churning air. Channeling his immaculate white

66
00:03:31.908 --> 00:03:34.820
flame along his blade, he plunged like a bolt of
holy lightning toward the Leviathan's glowing eye.

67
00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:40.790
[Ignis] "Begone into the
abyss, fiend of shadow!"

68
00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:44.089
The blazing strike pierced the beast's skull. Howling in agony,
the Leviathan thrashed and sank back into the ocean depths.

69
00:03:44.189 --> 00:03:46.760
Together, Kadan's immovable aegis and Ignis's
sanctifying flame had vanquished the ancient catastrophe.

70
00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:49.369
As the deluge receded and
peaceful swells returned,

71
00:03:49.469 --> 00:03:52.730
thousands of refugees across the
flower boats wept in joyous relief.

72
00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:55.744
Millions of colorful petals—lotus,
iris, and water lily—floated upon the

73
00:03:55.844 --> 00:03:58.700
tranquil emerald sea, blanketing the
horizon like a vast floral tapestry.

74
00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:01.426
A million floating blossoms bore silent

75
00:04:01.526 --> 00:04:04.670
witness to the triumph of
life over destruction.

76
00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:07.607
Yet beneath the waves, the
outer coral ramparts and ancient

77
00:04:07.707 --> 00:04:10.640
palaces of Whispering Wind Island
slowly slipped into the deep.

78
00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:13.648
Standing by the forward
railing, Cilia wiped away quiet

79
00:04:13.748 --> 00:04:16.610
tears as she watched her
homeland sink beneath the tide.

80
00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:22.580
Stepping to her side, Kadan
offered gentle solace.

81
00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:25.586
[Kadan] "Weep not, Cilia. The stone walls have sunk,
but the realm of the wind lives eternally within

82
00:04:25.686 --> 00:04:28.550
the hearts of the people you saved. So long as our
people draw breath, the kingdom shall never perish."

83
00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:31.887
Draping his cloak around
her shivering shoulders,

84
00:04:31.987 --> 00:04:34.520
Ignis looked toward the western horizon.

85
00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:37.812
[Ignis] "Our duty is not to stone and earth,
but to the living warmth of tomorrow.

86
00:04:37.912 --> 00:04:40.490
Now we march upon the capital to
bring Lucian and Zephyr to justice."

87
00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:43.484
Led by King Aeolus and Captain Rondol, the armada of
flower boats hoisted their canvas, sailing boldly toward

88
00:04:43.584 --> 00:04:46.460
the western continent. Beyond the jagged coastal peaks,
the golden dawn of a new era broke in dazzling splendor.

89
00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:49.540
The second arc of the SNS Heroes drew to its triumphant
close, opening the final battle for the fate

90
00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:52.430
of the realm. The ocean winds now filled their
sails like sturdy wings bearing them into history.

91
